# GLM Vector Math (STRICT)

Para matemáticas vectoriales, usar EXCLUSIVAMENTE la librería GLM con las macros `#define GLM_FORCE_RADIANS` y `#define GLM_FORCE_DEPTH_ZERO_TO_ONE` (vital para la profundidad en Vulkan).

## Rules

- Include GLM only via `engine/math/glm.hpp` (defines the macros, then includes GLM).
- Do not use alternative math libraries (Eigen, DirectXMath, handmade vec/mat, etc.) for vectors/matrices.
- Angles are always radians; clip depth is `[0, 1]` for Vulkan.
- Keep components POD / DOD-friendly when storing `glm::vec*` / `glm::mat*`.
